  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng brings the account from a banquet at Hai Shi blessed land, where Shark Demon and two other immortal zombies hosted him after he refused a visit to Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance itself. Long before that banquet she forced back enemies and took Time Anchor Immortal Gu, a time path Immortal Gu that can leave a mark in the river of time. She did not yet know its use, and heavy injuries left her no choice but to become an immortal zombie; Shark Demon then became an immortal zombie to accompany her despite still having ample lifespan. Years later the couple learned what Time Anchor did, but by then neither had left a mark before zombification.",
      "chapters": [
        746
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "loc_hai_shi_blessed_land",
        "char_shark_demon",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_zombie_alliance",
        "gu_time_anchor_immortal_gu",
        "path_time",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is an immortal zombie. Her zombie face is somewhat terrifying.",
      "chapters": [
        819
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her former beauty and elegance remain visible.",
      "chapters": [
        888
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Yu Lu blessed land she is the immortal zombie who names the link between raindrop equity and vanishing immortal essence dissipation rain when defenses fail. Shark Demon borrowed Profound Ice House for that trip after paying a large price under her urging, and she enters the house with him before the group forces a way out. After the retreat she asks Tai Bai Yun Sheng whether he has further business with the couple.",
      "chapters": [
        818
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yu-lu-attacks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land",
        "house_profound_ice_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that failure she weighs turning Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s regional-wall route over to Zombie Alliance for contribution points to offset their losses.",
      "chapters": [
        819
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "yu-lu-attacks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan later approaches the same circle under a false name, she presses him for a wisdom path demonstration and is still described as an immortal zombie whose former beauty remains visible.",
      "chapters": [
        888
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wisdom-path-demonstration",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a private shark banquet she speaks for her husband about his hobby of raising sharks and explains the rule that guests must catch gifted sharks themselves.",
      "chapters": [
        892
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shark-banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later meets the couple again as they attack Yu Lu blessed land, and she asks him to show wisdom path methods.",
      "chapters": [
        981
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "second-yu-lu-push",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After he exposes their one finger flow shark secret, she names that beast as their greatest secret and says they paid Song Jia Dan to conceal it.",
      "chapters": [
        982
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "secret-exposed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_jia_dan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Blazing Heaven Demoness routes Shark Demon and Shadow Sect schemes against Eastern Sea Zombie Alliance headquarters, she is turned into Gu materials used to refine sovereign immortal fetus Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1374
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "gu_sovereign_immortal_fetus_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later recollection states that she died and that Time Anchor Immortal Gu passed to Shadow Sect before that Gu was destroyed in the Battle of Yi Tian Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1810
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain"
      ]
    }
  ],
